window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>A dead conquest. </i></p> <p><i>A succubus signature. </i></p> <p><i>An edict sending the culprit back to Hell.</i> </p> <p><i>The culprit being me. </i></p> <p>My name is Gwen, and I’m a succubus with a control problem. Except, I didn’t create this mess. And the only one who believes me is the ruling monarch who has spent the last two decades helping me master my sinful nature. </p> <p>Lord Zebulon. </p> <p>The dangerously sexy demonic king of North America. Oh, that man makes me want to fall to my knees and let him do very wicked things to me. Except, right now, the only kneeling I’m doing is in the form of pleading. </p> <p>Because, I’m innocent. </p> <p>And we only have 10 days to prove it. </p> <p>The underworld trial has been set. </p> <p>My fate hangs in the balance. </p> <p>But I won’t go down without a fight. </p> <p><b>Author's note: </b> <i>Paramour of Sin </i>is a stand-alone paranormal romance featuring a demonic lord with a penchant for drawing blood and a wayward succubus known for her lethal touch.</p>"; 
